# Overview

Roc plus Datastar host a web application. Rocci templates are HTML for Roc.
Applications add server structure — standalone or custom. Rocdown is an
optional document layer on that same stack.

This manual describes **development** `main`. Behavior is experimental;
check commands against the source you built.

:note[title: "Maturity"] {{
    macOS and Linux development are tested in CI. Windows development uses the
    system webview and is documented only to that level. Production signing,
    installers, and a versioned release channel are not the install path yet.
}}

## Start here

Stop at the layer you need.

